# 证书私钥与 certbot 签发结果绝不入库（明文私钥！）。deploy/certs/ 仅保留 README 与占位。
deploy/certs/*.pem
deploy/certs/*.key
deploy/certs/*.crt
deploy/www/certbot/*
!deploy/www/certbot/.gitkeep
